# Golden-test failure artefacts.
#
# `/test/failures/` alone covers ONLY the top level, and flutter_test writes
# these beside the test that produced them -- `test/admin/failures/` had 24
# untracked PNGs sitting in the tree because the rule looked like it covered
# them and did not. Same near-miss shape as a `*.tmp` rule that never matches
# a `.tmp_` prefix.
test/**/failures/
/test/failures/
/nav_gopush.json

# Python bytecode from repo tooling scripts
__pycache__/
